WEBVTT

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.100
Another one.

00:01:04.603 --> 00:01:06.603
It's louder today.

00:01:13.175 --> 00:01:15.395
Nothing is louder here.

00:01:15.495 --> 00:01:17.895
Not for twenty years.

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:23.267
Then why can I still hear it?

00:02:17.267 --> 00:02:19.267
People of Corrow.

00:02:19.567 --> 00:02:21.967
The Chord is dying.

00:02:23.017 --> 00:02:25.467
We keep what is left.

00:02:25.958 --> 00:02:29.958
At dawn, Corrow will be quieted.

00:02:48.008 --> 00:02:49.208
Quieted.

00:02:49.468 --> 00:02:51.008
What does that even mean?

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.480
It means gone.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:56.070
No ship in.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:57.740
No ship out.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:58.800
Ever.

00:02:59.332 --> 00:03:01.592
They can't close a whole world.

00:03:02.083 --> 00:03:04.483
They closed your mother's.

00:03:14.535 --> 00:03:15.667
Then we leave tonight.

00:03:37.264 --> 00:03:39.134
You built a ship.

00:03:39.655 --> 00:03:41.175
Twenty years.

00:03:41.275 --> 00:03:44.075
One scrap at a time.

00:03:47.417 --> 00:03:51.017
She has never sung. Not once.

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:59.300
Bram. It's coming from her.

00:04:53.485 --> 00:04:55.485
There you are.

00:04:56.167 --> 00:04:58.567
She's a tuner's girl.

00:04:58.897 --> 00:05:00.897
She hears nothing.

00:05:02.959 --> 00:05:04.959
Everyone hears nothing here.

00:05:05.059 --> 00:05:07.459
That is the point.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.320
Little bird.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:14.550
There is no air left here to sing in.

00:05:15.042 --> 00:05:16.642
I'll find you.

00:06:38.708 --> 00:06:41.478
The Chord is dying, Lark.

00:06:41.578 --> 00:06:44.008
Every year it rings softer.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:48.540
We hold what is left, so someone can still cross the dark.

00:06:51.842 --> 00:06:54.592
By shutting us in it.

00:06:54.113 --> 00:06:56.923
Tomorrow this ring closes Corrow's still.

00:06:57.023 --> 00:06:59.293
Gently, if a Hearer guides it.

00:06:59.393 --> 00:07:01.383
Badly, if not.

00:07:01.875 --> 00:07:05.075
Where did you get that fork?

00:07:08.368 --> 00:07:09.758
My mother.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.600
Ilse Anwen.

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:14.140
She heard more than any of us.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:15.550
It broke her.

00:07:17.402 --> 00:07:19.342
You broke her.

00:07:22.093 --> 00:07:24.133
I made her quiet.

00:07:33.458 --> 00:07:35.098
Come on, girl.

00:07:35.198 --> 00:07:36.448
Fly first.

00:07:36.548 --> 00:07:37.508
Sing later.

00:08:15.857 --> 00:08:17.217
What is that?

00:08:20.908 --> 00:08:23.008
You can hear it?

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:24.210
No.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:26.110
I can see it.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:28.720
I was born on a bell-ship.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.800
I remember bells.

00:08:41.185 --> 00:08:42.075
Listen.

00:08:42.175 --> 00:08:46.575
Tell me its note, and we close it gently.

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:56.850
It isn't fading.

00:08:57.210 --> 00:08:59.610
They are drinking it.

00:09:12.397 --> 00:09:14.597
You're not saving the Chord.

00:09:14.697 --> 00:09:16.697
You're drinking it.

00:09:19.808 --> 00:09:22.608
Tell me the note, Lark.

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:50.170
Primate.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:54.220
Corrow will be quiet within the hour.

00:09:56.082 --> 00:09:58.082
Let nothing ring.

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:17.790
Do it.

00:10:38.368 --> 00:10:39.568
No!

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:42.960
Lark!

00:11:46.983 --> 00:11:51.483
If I let go, it closes again.

00:11:54.565 --> 00:11:56.345
Then I won't let go.

00:11:56.445 --> 00:11:57.215
Go.

00:11:57.315 --> 00:11:59.175
She's waiting for you.

00:12:00.636 --> 00:12:02.586
Ring her, Lark.

00:12:02.686 --> 00:12:04.966
She was always yours.

00:12:14.781 --> 00:12:17.181
That is Ilse's fork.

00:12:21.633 --> 00:12:23.625
And that's her daughter's note.

00:12:46.185 --> 00:12:47.745
They aim for the bell.

00:12:47.845 --> 00:12:49.675
They want it quiet, not broken.

00:13:05.843 --> 00:13:07.633
I've never rung a ship.

00:13:17.898 --> 00:13:19.178
That's my note.

00:13:19.278 --> 00:13:20.878
It was never in my head.

00:13:20.978 --> 00:13:22.978
It was her.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:27.800
Then ring her!

00:13:29.532 --> 00:13:31.132
Ring out.

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:09.660
Provost.

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:11.760
Find the girl.

00:14:29.748 --> 00:14:33.628
Unknown bell, you rang in on an unscored note.

00:14:33.728 --> 00:14:35.258
Where from?

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.050
Corrow.

00:14:42.132 --> 00:14:44.932
Nobody rings out of Corrow.

00:14:50.193 --> 00:14:51.633
She just did.

00:15:11.312 --> 00:15:12.592
There's another one.
